# intentionally compact, and regenerated from upstream data rather than hand-edited, so `bun fmt`
# has no business reformatting it (Ruling R11).
src/data/gen/
src/data/sprites/
# Agent worktrees live under .claude/worktrees inside the repo (Ruling R23); `bun fmt --check`
# must not trip over another agent's in-progress files there.
.claude/
# Agent scratch reports/plans (superpowers skill) appear untracked in fresh worktrees;
# `bun fmt --check` must not scan them.
.superpowers/
